1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 4=

19
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,159
Suzhen, get up already.

20
00:02:07,374 --> 00:02:11,533
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

21
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,759
Miss Bai, there's a talisman
tucked inside my collar.

22
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:20,560
Take it out and place it on my chest.

23
00:02:26,515 --> 00:02:30,982
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

24
00:02:33,847 --> 00:02:38,288
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

25
00:02:40,484 --> 00:02:45,214
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

26
00:02:46,426 --> 00:02:52,539
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

27
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,400
(His skin is burning hot.)

28
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:59,560
(Why is my heart racing so fast?)

29
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,879
Thank you, Miss Bai.

30
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:26,960
Pardon my impropriety earlier.

31
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,240
You should be thanking me.

32
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,879
I spent all my savings
buying the house for you.

33
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:38,520
Now, I can't even afford an inn.

34
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,080
I'm staying at your place.

35
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,759
(Deed)

36
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:43,960
I paid for it.

37
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,879
I'm your creditor now.

38
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,840
Suzhen.

39
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,120
Xu Xian signed the deed.

40
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:59,719
The house belongs to him.

41
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:07,120
Miss Bai, don't worry.

42
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,080
I'm not an ungrateful man.

43
00:04:09,599 --> 00:04:10,719
Although the house is old,

44
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,439
it has plenty of empty rooms.

45
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,080
You and Qing can settle in.

46
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,160
Where are you going?

47
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,160
I have something to do.

48
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:35,000
A sudden change in temperament,

49
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,560
and surrounded by crows...

50
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:40,240
I hope Miss Lin is all right.

51
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,199
After the way she treated you,

52
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,959
you still care about her?

53
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:48,079
It's not about caring.

54
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,519
Hunting demons is my duty.

55
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,680
Immortal,

56
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,279
I've nourished you with pure thoughts.

57
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,079
Now the time has come.

58
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,639
Please grant my wish.

59
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:55,000
Mind, return to place.

60
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,160
All evil, begone!

61
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:08,879
Three months ago, I stayed
at Shanyao Village while praying

62
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,079
on the mountain.

63
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,920
A farmer told me

64
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,439
an immortal on the mountain

65
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,160
could grant anything one desired.

66
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:19,199
I had feelings for Young Master Xu
for so long back then,

67
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:22,879
so I couldn't resist the temptation.

68
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:27,120
Do you know you've been feeding
an evil demon, the Rakshasa Bird?

69
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,839
How could I know?

70
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,759
That man clearly said
it was an immortal.

71
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,720
This is the token
the evil demon used to bind you.

72
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,199
Once the ritual is done,

73
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,079
it will devour your kindness,

74
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,839
take full control of you,

75
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,040
and turn you into a mindless beast.

76
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,480
If I hadn't saved you today,

77
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,079
you'd be dead.

78
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,240
Thank you for saving my life.

79
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,600
I have no way to repay you...

80
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,600
Your leaving him alone

81
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,680
is repayment enough.

82
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:03,319
Then... will this token
come back for me?

83
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:05,439
Don't worry.

84
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:07,199
It won't.

85
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:12,680
I can use it to track
the evil demon's whereabouts.

86
00:07:13,319 --> 00:07:14,399
It's useless.

87
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,360
This token was bound to it.

88
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,439
The demonic energy is gone.

89
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,000
You can't track it.

90
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:24,079
Your servant knows spells too?

91
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,839
He's traveled the world for years

92
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:30,360
and picked up some self-defense.

93
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,839
The demonic energy is gone,

94
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,680
but I still want
to try tracking it with a spell.

95
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,920
After it!

96
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,600
Thank you.

97
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,720
Here you are.

98
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:09,199
Look at our Senior Brother,

99
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:10,879
keeping the Leifeng Pagoda
as a decoration.

100
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,040
It's been ten years.

101
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,279
He can't wield the artifact

102
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,360
or keep the Five Precepts.

103
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,199
To think the Abbot values him so much.

104
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,639
So what if he does?

105
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:20,120
The head disciple
of the Jinshan Temple's Abbot

106
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,160
is nothing but a failure.

107
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,360
No wonder
he hasn't been ordained by now.

108
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,639
He upset the Abbot so much
as to break the ordination knife.

109
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,040
We're out of rice.

110
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,879
My hearing is sharp, you know.

111
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,080
Next time you gossip,

112
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,919
be sure to do it past Sanjiang Street.

113
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,919
Not enough rice.

114
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,240
I'll go buy some more.

115
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,039
Why should we?

116
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:54,679
Young Master, could you spare
a bowl of hot porridge?

117
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,679
You can have as much as you like, Miss.

118
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:07,799
(That accursed demon hunter.
He won't leave me alone.)

119
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,399
Miss, here's your porridge.

120
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:14,919
Young Master,
I have a sick child at home.

121
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:18,360
Could you please have mercy
and come take a look?

122
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,440
All right.

123
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:33,799
Where is your child, Miss?

124
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:35,559
Please follow me.

125
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,080
What lovely eyes.

126
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,720
Y-You're a demon!

127
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:57,039
Young Master, grant my wish.

128
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,039
He's clearly dead,

129
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:24,600
yet he looks like
he's chanting scriptures.

130
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,639
He was arranged in a pose of repentance.

131
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,960
Watch out!

132
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,159
I thought it was some supreme spell,

133
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,879
but it's just a spatial trick.

134
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:10,639
Is that all you've got?

135
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,399
I only want to shred those scoundrels.

136
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:18,679
White Snake, I'll kill you!

137
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,279
I'll kill you!

138
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,600
(Rakshasa Bird's Yin-Void Illusion)

139
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,360
(amplifies a person's
desires and fears.)

140
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:28,000
(What on earth is he seeing?)

141
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,000
Father.

142
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:38,399
Father!

143
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:42,799
Mother.

144
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:48,159
Master Hanshan,
please take me as your disciple

145
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,799
and teach me to slay demons.

146
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:54,559
As long as I can avenge my parents,

147
00:11:55,799 --> 00:12:01,279
I'll go through fire and water for you.

148
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,919
(A demonic aura hangs in the air.)

149
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,679
Knowing revenge will trap him in hatred

150
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:50,360
and keep him from living a normal life,

151
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,799
he still chose this path.

152
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:57,000
Is the White Snake in his memories

153
00:12:58,879 --> 00:13:00,080
really me?

154
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,080
Strange.

155
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:17,399
As a great demon,

156
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,919
there isn't a hint of malice in you.

157
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,320
How could such a pure soul
exist in this world?

158
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:28,840
Let me take a closer look.

159
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,480
No need.

160
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:38,440
A petty demon like you
won't see anything anyway.

161
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,120
How intriguing.

162
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:45,279
What is your relationship
with this mortal?

163
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,720
None of your business.

164
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:53,039
Such a powerful demon,
yet so utterly naive.

165
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,480
White Snake,

166
00:13:59,039 --> 00:14:00,679
if you're what I hate,

167
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,360
why did you approach me?

168
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,399
You love me when I'm human

169
00:14:05,679 --> 00:14:07,039
but hate me when I'm a demon?

170
00:14:07,919 --> 00:14:10,159
You promised to love me forever.

171
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,240
And now,

172
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:15,399
you want to kill me?

173
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,639
At least make it believable.

174
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:19,879
Do you even know who I am?

175
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:22,559
I've cultivated for 500 years.

176
00:14:22,759 --> 00:14:25,360
I'm not some mortal girl
blinded by love.

177
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,559
Even if I lost my mind,

178
00:14:27,879 --> 00:14:29,480
such a day would never come.

179
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,440
Then do you know

180
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,879
that once touched by love,

181
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:42,799
it clings to you and never fades?

182
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,919
It's like bone-eroding poison

183
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:48,320
or a dagger to the heart.

184
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,200
Even with hundreds of years
of cultivation,

185
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:55,720
you'll throw it all away.

186
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:03,320
Petty trick.

187
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:11,759
Look at this half-snake,
half-drake freak.

188
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,600
An unnatural monster.

189
00:15:13,759 --> 00:15:16,080
Let's strip her and see
if it's male or female.

190
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:19,159
Let me go! Let me go!

191
00:15:53,965 --> 00:15:58,124
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

192
00:16:00,591 --> 00:16:04,969
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

193
00:16:06,512 --> 00:16:12,337
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

194
00:16:13,106 --> 00:16:17,573
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

195
00:16:20,438 --> 00:16:24,879
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

196
00:16:27,075 --> 00:16:31,805
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

197
00:16:33,017 --> 00:16:39,130
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

198
00:16:39,793 --> 00:16:45,575
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

199
00:16:45,575 --> 00:16:51,838
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

200
00:16:52,148 --> 00:16:58,507
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

201
00:16:58,678 --> 00:17:06,045
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

202
00:17:06,330 --> 00:17:11,877
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

203
00:17:12,368 --> 00:17:18,578
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

204
00:17:18,888 --> 00:17:25,661
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

205
00:17:26,658 --> 00:17:32,311
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

206
00:17:33,145 --> 00:17:37,553
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

207
00:17:38,318 --> 00:17:40,906
♪Having ever loved♪
